ured cultivation trials and adequate food reserves over expanding untested production.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"root-cultivation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I establish and maintain a renewable supply of safe meadow roots?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Root nutrition is known as 14 with toxicity zero.\\\",\\\"Planting completed at tick 43 at (20.04, 8.2).\\\",\\\"At tick 192 the established mature plot had one visible root.\\\",\\\"Owned root item-197-wren-2201 records quantity one harvested from plot-42-wren-465 at tick 197.\\\",\\\"Inspection at tick 198 reports visible stock changing from one to zero after harvest.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"One harvest is confirmed; the harvested unit's perceivable condition and repeatable post-harvest yield remain untested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Verify harvested food condition and subsequent regrowth without compromising reserves or health.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Planted one root.\\\",\\\"Observed establishment and mature stage.\\\",\\\"Observed visible stock increase from zero to one.\\\",\\\"Harvested one root and observed the corresponding stock decrease.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Established root plot plot-42-wren-465.\\\",\\\"One owned root harvested from the plot at tick 197.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Examination of the harvested unit and evidence of regrowth after removal.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Examine the harvested root, then inspect the plot after a bounded observation interval.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The plot has supplied one actual harvested root; sustained yield has not yet been demonstrated.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

